      <VERS vnumber="6"> For the punishment of the <gr str="5771">iniquity </gr>of the <gr str="1323">daughter </gr>of my <gr str="5971">people </gr>is <gr str="1431">greater </gr>than the punishment of the <gr str="4480 2403">sin </gr>of <gr str="5467">Sodom</gr>, that was <gr str="2015">overthrown </gr>as <gr str="3644">in </gr>a <gr str="7281">moment</gr>, and <gr str="3808">no </gr>
