      <VERS vnumber="7"> Her <gr str="5139">Nazarites </gr>were <gr str="2141">purer </gr>than <gr str="4480 7950">snow</gr>, they were <gr str="6705">whiter </gr>than <gr str="4480 2461">milk</gr>, they were more <gr str="119">ruddy </gr>in <gr str="6106">body </gr>than <gr str="4480 6443">rubies</gr>, their <gr str="1508">polishing </gr>
