      <VERS vnumber="12"> The <gr str="4428">kings </gr>of the <gr str="776">earth</gr>, and <gr str="3605">all </gr>the <gr str="3427">inhabitants </gr>of the <gr str="8398">world</gr>, would <gr str="3808">not </gr>have <gr str="539">believed </gr>
