      <VERS vnumber="13"> For the <gr str="4480 2403">sins </gr>of her <gr str="5030">prophets</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> and </STYLE> the <gr str="5771">iniquities </gr>of her <gr str="3548">priests</gr>, that have <gr str="8210">shed </gr>the <gr str="1818">blood </gr>of the <gr str="6662">just </gr>in the <gr str="7130">midst </gr>of her, </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="14"> They have <gr str="5128">wandered </gr>
