        <gr str="5060">touch </gr>their <gr str="3830">garments</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15"> They <gr str="7121">cried </gr>unto them, <gr str="5493">Depart </gr>ye; <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> it </STYLE>
