      <VERS vnumber="20"> The <gr str="7307">breath </gr>of our <gr str="639">nostrils</gr>, the <gr str="4899">anointed </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, was <gr str="3920">taken </gr>in their <gr str="7825">pits</gr>, of <gr str="834">whom </gr>we <gr str="559">said</gr>, Under his <gr str="6738">shadow </gr>we shall <gr str="2421">live </gr>among the <gr str="1471">heathen</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="21">
        <gr str="7797">Rejoice </gr>and be <gr str="8055">glad</gr>, O <gr str="1323">daughter </gr>of <gr str="123">Edom</gr>, that <gr str="3427">dwellest </gr>in the <gr str="776">land </gr>of <gr str="5780">Uz</gr>; the <gr str="3563">cup </gr>
