      <VERS vnumber="22"> The punishment of thine <gr str="5771">iniquity </gr>is <gr str="8552">accomplished</gr>, O <gr str="1323">daughter </gr>of <gr str="6726">Zion</gr>; he will <gr str="3808">no </gr>
